## sanitizeScope API
```typescript
interface SanitizeResult {
  filesWrite: string[];
  warnings: string[];
  rejected: string[];
}
function sanitizeScope(filesWrite: string[]): SanitizeResult;
```

## Filter Rules (in order)
1. Absolute paths → reject
2. Path traversal (..) → reject
3. dist/ prefix → remove
4. Extension-only (.ts, .md) → remove
5. Unqualified filename (no directory separator) → remove + warning
6. Global protected (config.json, package.json, tsconfig.json) → remove
7. "(yeni)" suffix strip
8. Duplicate paths (case-insensitive) → dedupe
